      "id": "MintPlayer.SourceGenerators.TestHarness",
      "range": "*"
    },
    "message": "This package (which targets .NET 11) already was on version 13.x.x\nAutomated package version would want to put it on 11.x.x now, which is no longer possible.\nSo you'll just need to use MintPlayer.SourceGenerators.TestHarness instead (which is the same package in another name)",
    "reasons": [
      "Legacy"
    ]
  },
  "description": "Test source generators, analyzers and code fixes in-process, so a coverage collector actually attributes the generator's own code. Loads the component from the test host's output directory rather than through Roslyn's analyzer path, where instrumentation never reaches it.",
